---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<MainLayout title="Yoyo | AI Research Assistant">


<Navbar />


<section class="assistant-page">


<div class="header">


<div class="robot">
🤖
</div>


<h1>
AI研究助手 <span class="en">AI Research Assistant</span>
</h1>


<p>
陪伴我探索研究旅程的智能助手。 <span class="en">An intelligent assistant for exploring my research journey.</span>
</p>


</div>





<div class="chat-container">


<div class="message user">


<div class="avatar">
👤
</div>


<div class="bubble">
告诉我你的医学AI研究。 <span class="en">Tell me about your medical AI research.</span>
</div>


</div>





<div class="message ai">


<div class="avatar">
🤖
</div>


<div class="bubble">
Yoyo的研究聚焦于医学影像AI，特别是基于MRI的疾病预测与多模态深度学习系统。
<span class="en">Yoyo's research focuses on medical imaging AI, especially MRI-based disease prediction and multimodal deep learning systems.</span>

<br><br>

当前研究方向包括：
<span class="en">Current interests include:</span>

<br>

• MRI分析
<span class="en">• MRI Analysis</span>

<br>

• 视觉语言模型
<span class="en">• Vision Language Models</span>

<br>

• 可解释AI
<span class="en">• Explainable AI</span>
</div>


</div>



</div>






<div class="input-area">


<input
placeholder="询问我的研究..."
disabled
/>


<button
onclick="gtag('event', 'assistant_usage', {interaction: 'send_click'})">
发送 <span class="en">Send</span>
</button>


</div>







<div class="future">


<h2>
未来集成 <span class="en">Future Integration</span>
</h2>


<div class="features">


<div>
📚
<br>
研究论文 <span class="en">Research Papers</span>
</div>



<div>
🧠
<br>
AI模型 <span class="en">AI Models</span>
</div>



<div>
💻
<br>
代码仓库 <span class="en">Code Repository</span>
</div>



<div>
📖
<br>
知识库 <span class="en">Knowledge Base</span>
</div>



</div>



</div>



</section>


</MainLayout>





<style>



.assistant-page{


padding:

140px 10% 100px;


background:

#FFF9F5;


min-height:

100vh;


}





.header{


text-align:center;


margin-bottom:

60px;


}



.robot{


font-size:

80px;


}



.header h1{


font-size:

65px;


margin:

20px;


}



.header p{


font-size:

20px;


color:#33f9db;


}






.chat-container{


max-width:

800px;


margin:auto;


display:flex;


flex-direction:column;


gap:

30px;


}






.message{


display:flex;


gap:

20px;


align-items:flex-start;


}




.avatar{


font-size:

35px;


}




.bubble{


padding:

25px;


border-radius:

30px;


font-size:

18px;


line-height:

1.8;


}



.user .bubble{


background:

#f9cfe0;


}



.ai .bubble{


background:

hsl(218, 100%, 86%);


}





.input-area{


margin:

50px auto;


max-width:

800px;


display:flex;


gap:

15px;


}





input{


flex:1;


padding:

20px;


border-radius:

30px;


border:

none;


background:white;


font-size:

16px;


}





button{


padding:

15px 35px;


border-radius:

30px;


border:none;


background:

#ffa6cd;


}




.future{


margin-top:

100px;


text-align:center;


}





.features{


display:grid;


grid-template-columns:

repeat(4,1fr);


gap:

25px;


margin-top:

40px;


}





.features div{


padding:

30px;


border-radius:

30px;


background:white;


font-size:

20px;


}





@media(max-width:900px){


.features{


grid-template-columns:

1fr;


}


}



</style>